ed subscription details:</p>        <!-- Success Box -->       <div class=\"success-box\">         <p>🎉 Your subscription is now Active until {{ $('Calculate Renewal Dates').item.json['End Date'] }}</p>       </div>        <!-- Details Table -->       <table class=\"details-table\">         <tr>           <td>Full Name</td>           <td>{{ $('Calculate Renewal Dates').item.json['Full Name'] }}</td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td>Email</td>           <td>{{ $('Calculate Renewal Dates').item.json['Email'] }}</td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td>Subscription Plan</td>           <td>{{ $('Calculate Renewal Dates').item.json['Subscription'] }}</td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td>Status</td>           <td>✅ Active</td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td>New Start Date</td>           <td>{{ $('Calculate Renewal Dates').item.json['Start Date'] }}</td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td>New Expiry Date</td>           <td>{{ $('Calculate Renewal Dates').item.json['End Date'] }}</td>         </tr>       </table>        <p>Thank you for renewing your subscription. If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is always here to help.</p>        <center>         <a href=\"mailto:admin@berryexcel.online\" class=\"btn\">Contact Support</a>       </center>        <p style=\"margin-top:24px; font-size:13px; color:#999;\">If you did not initiate this renewal, please contact our support team immediately.</p>     </div>      <!-- Footer -->     <div class=\"footer\">       <p>© 2026 BerryExcel. All rights reserved.</p>       <p>You are receiving this email because your subscription was recently renewed.</p>     </div>    </div> </body> </html>",
